; A chain deeper than the inline limit (32) is split into variables, so drivers whose C front end
; limits bracket nesting (clang: 256) or recurses on the native stack can build it.
; RUN: tc-lower %s | FileCheck %s
; ---- autogenerated by utils/update-checks.py; edit with care ----
; CHECK-LABEL: device chain(f32 x, f32 y) -> f32 {
